      "textEn": "{ko:설날} (Seollal) is the Lunar New Year. A common greeting then is {ko:새해 복 많이 받으세요}, a wish that the other person has a lucky year ahead.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "설, an entry of the Encyclopedia of Korean Culture",
